# DRAW keymap preset: Adobe Photoshop (default keyboard shortcuts; Mac Cmd = Ctrl)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on printable non-letters like > { + _ , typed with it).
#   A row that must leave Shift+key alone (Ctrl+] vs Ctrl+Shift+]) writes forbidMods 6.
#   Ctrl+Shift+punctuation is the UNshifted key with Ctrl+Shift: Ctrl+Shift+' = 39 3 (not 34).
#   Keycodes: letters are lowercase ASCII (Shift+letter = the letter, requireMods 2);
#   Tab 9, Backspace 8, Enter 13, Insert 20992, Delete 21248, F1 15104 ... F10 17408,
#   F11 34048, F12 34304. Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (that DRAW action loses the key)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Mac apps: Cmd is Ctrl here, Option is Alt.
# Already the same in DRAW (no row): B brush, E eraser, M marquee, W magic wand,
#   I eyedropper, T type, V move, Z zoom, X swap colours, [ ] brush size, 1-0 opacity,
#   Ctrl+Z undo, Ctrl+Shift+Z redo, Ctrl+A / Ctrl+D / Ctrl+Shift+I select all / deselect /
#   inverse, Ctrl+Shift+N new layer, Ctrl+G group, Ctrl+Shift+] / [ bring to front / back,
#   Ctrl+= / Ctrl+- zoom, Delete clear, Ctrl+N / O / S / Shift+S / Q.
# Not in DRAW (no row): J healing, S clone stamp, Y history brush, O dodge / burn,
#   A path selection, H hand (DRAW: hold Space), Q quick mask, Ctrl+Shift+D reselect,
#   Ctrl+Y proof colours (stays Redo), Ctrl+R rulers (stays Reference Image).
# DRAW keys this preset gives to Photoshop's jobs: L line, C ellipse, F fill, D dot,
#   Tab toolbar, F6 pixel perfect, F7 symmetry, Ctrl+E clear selection (Delete still
#   clears), Ctrl+T custom-font text, Ctrl+' grid mode, Ctrl+J / Ctrl+K were free.
#   Kept because Photoshop leaves them unused: R rectangle, Q bezier, Ctrl+L layers, F11.

# --- Tools ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
119 108 0 0     # L        lasso                  -> Freehand Select
120 108 2 0     # Shift+L  polygonal lasso        -> Polygon Select
121 109 2 0     # Shift+M  elliptical marquee     -> Ellipse Select
1802 99 0 0     # C        crop                   -> Crop Canvas
102 98 2 0      # Shift+B  pencil (brush group)   -> Dot
103 103 0 0     # G        paint bucket           -> Fill
122 113 0 0     # Q        (DRAW's bezier key, kept)
122 112 0 0     # P        pen                    -> Bezier
108 114 0 0     # R        (DRAW's rectangle key, kept)
108 117 0 0     # U        rectangle (shape group)
110 117 2 0     # Shift+U  ellipse (shape group)
518 100 0 0     # D        default colours
453 102 0 0     # F        screen modes           -> Toggle Fullscreen
403 34048 0 0   # F11      (DRAW's own key, kept)
403 9 0 0       # Tab      hide panels            -> Toggle All UI
437 9 2 0       # Shift+Tab  hide panels, keep tools -> Hide/Show Right Side UI

# --- Layers / edit ---------------------------------------------------------------------
321 106 1 0     # Ctrl+J        layer via copy     -> Copy to New Layer
323 106 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+J  layer via cut      -> Cut to New Layer
705 101 1 0     # Ctrl+E        merge down
706 101 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+E  merge visible
722 103 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+G  ungroup layers
703 93 1 6      # Ctrl+]        bring forward      -> Move Layer Up
704 91 1 6      # Ctrl+[        send backward      -> Move Layer Down
325 116 1 0     # Ctrl+T        free transform
1805 105 5 0    # Ctrl+Alt+I    image size         -> Resize Image with Content
1801 99 5 0     # Ctrl+Alt+C    canvas size        -> Resize Canvas
313 8 4 0       # Alt+Backspace   fill with foreground
314 8 1 0       # Ctrl+Backspace  fill with background

# --- View / panels ----------------------------------------------------------------------
405 48 1 0      # Ctrl+0        (DRAW's own key, kept)
405 49 1 0      # Ctrl+1        100%               -> Reset Zoom
8101 39 0 0     # '             (DRAW's grid key, kept)
8101 39 1 6     # Ctrl+'        show grid
404 108 1 0     # Ctrl+L        (DRAW's own key, kept)
404 16640 0 0   # F7            layers panel
2021 16384 0 0  # F6            colour panel       -> Color Mixer
2100 107 1 0    # Ctrl+K        preferences        -> Settings
2360 107 7 0    # Ctrl+Alt+Shift+K  keyboard shortcuts -> Customize Controls
